SUMMARY:Women's Breakfast (Assembly Room)
DESCRIPTION:Finding My Purpose: Animal Chaplaincy \nVicki Lea Paulson \nA life-long animal lover\, Vicki Lea began her journey to animal chaplaincy with hands on experience as a teenager working with her father in his veterinary practice. After a professional career in business and nonprofit fundraising\, she found her call to animal chaplaincy. In June 2026\, after 200+ hours of training\, she was ordained as an Animal Chaplain. Vicki will share the story of her journey and what she does as an animal chaplain.
URL:https://www.unioncong.org/event/womens-breakfast-assembly-room-3/
LOCATION:Assembly Room and Kitchen\, 176 Cooper Avenue\, Montclair\, 07043\, United States
CATEGORIES:All Church Events,All Events,Featured Events,Small Groups
ORGANIZER;CN="Union Congregational Event":MAILTO:contact@unioncong.org
END:VEVENT
